LOCUS       ReadingFrameOffsets       24 bp    DNA     linear   SYN 22-OCT-2026
DEFINITION  Original synthetic fixture for native CDS reading-frame semantics.
ACCESSION   POPGENE_FRAME_OFFSETS
VERSION     POPGENE_FRAME_OFFSETS.1
KEYWORDS    synthetic; reading frame.
SOURCE      synthetic sequence
  ORGANISM  synthetic sequence
COMMENT     Original PopGene synthetic data. Four overlapping CDSs deliberately
            exercise codon_start=1/2/3 and reverse codon_start=2. No cached
            translations are supplied. Expected table-1 amino acids in coding
            order: forward_1 MK*PLFHT, forward_2 *NNRYFI, forward_3 EITVISY,
            reverse_2 V*NNGYF. This fixture tests display, not biological ORFs.
FEATURES             Location/Qualifiers
     CDS             1..24
                     /label="forward_1"
                     /codon_start=1
                     /transl_table=1
     CDS             1..24
                     /label="forward_2"
                     /codon_start=2
                     /transl_table=1
     CDS             1..24
                     /label="forward_3"
                     /codon_start=3
                     /transl_table=1
     CDS             complement(1..24)
                     /label="reverse_2"
                     /codon_start=2
                     /transl_table=1
ORIGIN
        1 atgaaataac cgttatttca tacg
